{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"03.03","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":86,"reply_count":31,"alternative_count":13,"total_audio_count":130,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"03.03.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我忘带钥匙了。","meaning_my":"သော့ ယူလာဖို့ မေ့သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我过来给你送钥匙。","meaning_my":"သော့ လာပို့ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"钥匙忘带了。","meaning_my":"သော့ ယူလာဖို့ မေ့သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"帮我开门。","meaning_my":"တံခါးလေး ဖွင့်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"你先等等，我来开门。","meaning_my":"ခဏစောင့်ဦး၊ လာဖွင့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"门锁了吗？","meaning_my":"တံခါး သော့ခတ်ပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"门已经锁好了。","meaning_my":"တံခါး သော့ခတ်ပြီးပြီ။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"门锁好了没？","meaning_my":"တံခါး သော့ခတ်ပြီးပြီလား။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"你带钥匙了吗？","meaning_my":"သော့ ယူလာခဲ့လား။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"出门记得锁门。","meaning_my":"အပြင်ထွက်ရင် တံခါး သော့ခတ်ဖို့ မမေ့နဲ့နော်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"门打不开。","meaning_my":"တံခါး ဖွင့်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"门锁不上。","meaning_my":"တံခါး သော့ခတ်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"门关不上。","meaning_my":"တံခါး ပိတ်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"钥匙在你那儿吗？","meaning_my":"သော့ ရှိသေးလား။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"钥匙在桌上。","meaning_my":"သော့က စားပွဲပေါ်မှာ။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"备用钥匙在哪儿？","meaning_my":"အပိုသော့ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"我把钥匙忘在屋里了。","meaning_my":"သော့ကို အခန်းထဲမှာ မေ့ကျန်ခဲ့တယ်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"钥匙丢了怎么办？","meaning_my":"သော့ ပျောက်သွားရင် ဘယ်လိုလုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我去叫开锁师傅。","meaning_my":"သော့ဖွင့်သမားကို ခေါ်လိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"是不是从里面反锁了？","meaning_my":"အထဲကနေ သော့ခတ်ထားတာလား။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"钥匙插不进去。","meaning_my":"သော့ပေါက်ထဲ သော့ထိုးလို့မဝင်ဘူး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"钥匙转不动。","meaning_my":"သော့ လှည့်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S015_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"钥匙拧不动。","meaning_my":"သော့ လှည့်လို့မရဘူး။","audio_file":"03.03.01-S015_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"03.03.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"门卡住了。","meaning_my":"တံခါး ညပ်